## Model

**tile access**：多个层次**tile之间**的数据传输，和overlap data（**delta**）相关；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2057.png)

