# ISCA24（pret）

**ISCA24**:Soter: Analytical Tensor-Architecture Modeling and Automatic Tensor Program Tuning for Spatial Accelerators

研究问题：基于现有的**张量程序**，生成**目标硬件**上执行的，**有效、高效**的张量程序；

现有方法：vendor lib由芯片设计方**人工编写**；poly model基于硬件的Modeling，建立张量程序的优化空间，但需要**某类**硬件的**具体**Model，不能直接用在不同硬件上；

本文：基于Cosa提出的**硬件和程序抽象**，使用**多步**优化目标函数，**逐步裁剪**设计空间，弱化通过建模硬件来精准刻画设计空间的需求；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2066.png)

## idea

auto-tuning

Q：生成**无效或低效**的程序，程序生成/Mapping过程中**不能准确评估不完整**的程序性能；

方法：**分析模型**生成高性能程序的设计空间；

不完整程序：设计参数没有完全确定的张量程序；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2067.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2068.png)

Tensor Mapping:张量映射到Acc执行,包含vendor lib、polyhedral model、auto-tuning;

vendor lib由芯片设计方人工编写功能函数到DLA的tensor mapping;

poly model基于**人工设计**目标函数和约束的优化方法,对loop order和tiling的整数规划,性能可推断;

**auto**-tuning构建**映射后程序的设计空间**后搜索**生成**,生成方法包含beam搜索（每步增加候选项，如同光束beam）、模拟退火、遗传、分析的cost模型、DL的cost模型;

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2069.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2070.png)

poly model和auto-tuning区别是?

cost model是**线性**目标函数和张量计算的n-loop优化过程是**非线性的**；

poly model**建模**特定类型（Spatial）硬件架构，建立程序**设计空间**后，优化目标函数进行**搜索**，不能直接推广到不同硬件架构;

**auto**-tuning是降低硬件建模获得的知识（**不确定的参数和不细致的约束**），通过多步优化目标函数来直接搜索空间，本质在搜索中近似硬件架构

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2071.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2072.png)

auto-tuning方法分为sequence-guided和template-guided;

seq-g**逐个评估**每个参数的可能值下程序性能,选择每个参数top-k性能的可能值,但**不完整**(未完全确定所有参数)的程序性能难以评估,影响序列化决策的优化;

temp-g**同时优化确定**所有参数,评估不同参数组合的完整程序性能,但无法准确约束每个参数的搜索子空间,因为不同参数搜索子空间之间存在影响和约束,所以生成大量**无效**(违背Acc约束)和**低效**(低资源使用率)程序;

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2073.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2074.png)

基于seq-g,使用**Transformer来评估不完整程序**后给出下一步优化方向,避免top-k方法无法准确评估不完整的程序性能的问题;

seq-g的分析模型**更新参数搜索子空间**,auto-tunner优化tensor程序的设计参数;

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2075.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2076.png)

张量计算Mapping到Acc张量程序,设计**Acc张量程序的生成空间**;

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2077.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2078.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2079.png)

seq-g很难评估不完整程序,temp-g没有筛选无效的搜索子空间;

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2080.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2081.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2082.png)

## 方法

Soter workflow

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2083.png)

**分析模型**生成tensor程序设计空间,优化参数后去除无效和低效的搜索子空间;

**auto-tunner**面向Acc生成高性能程序,分步确定设计参数**范围**,**全部确定后评估性能**;

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2084.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2085.png)

建模空间base: tensor计算、Acc架构**建模** >> tensor程序的**设计空间**;

操作逻辑:在搜索空间中,分阶段优化设计参数 && 去除无效和低效的子空间;

结果:高性能tensor程序(loop order、time tiling、spatial tiling/parallel);

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2086.png)

**分析模型**建立有效、高效程序的搜索空间;

valid:tile-size不超过所在层的存储容量,parallel-size不超过所在层的计算容量;

efficient:tilesize-p需要超过所在层的计算容量,tilesize-p是tile-size和parallel-size的函数;

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2087.png)

GEMM和CONV的**存储容量约束**

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2088.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2089.png)

**不等式的可行解求解**:假设其余参数最小,获得特定参数最大值,之后**根据搜索确定特定参数**后,确定其余参数的最大值;

确定特定参数的最大值的顺序不重要?重要的是**约束搜索空间**?

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2090.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2091.png)

计算容量的valid约束

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2092.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2093.png)

计算容量的efficient约束

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2094.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2095.png)

auto-tuner:每个参数视为1个token,Transformer作为策略（agent），分步输出优化参数子空间上的概率分布，无效或低效的选择概率是0，隐态h（上下文信息）迭代B次；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2096.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2097.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2098.png)

Transformer模型训练**不使用标签**，用Reward（**延迟**）和策略参数（概率分布）的乘积作为优化函数，延迟通过评估tensor程序性能得到；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%2099.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20100.png)

分析模型和auto-tuner的协作coordinate：分析模型根据tuner的每一步的优化参数裁剪搜索空间，tuner每一步优化基于裁剪后的搜索空间；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20101.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20102.png)

