## 方法

约束优化问题

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20121.png)

