![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20130.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20131.png)

定义 **schedule** configuration = prime factor allocation，用variable矩阵X表示调度；

factor（**n**）-dimension（**j**）allocation decision：memory level（**i**）、permutation order（**z**）、spatial Mapping（**k**）；

每个factor**仅使用一次**，即仅分配到一个memory level的slot；

factor分配到相同level memory中不同rank的slot，根据**rank大小**决定该factor-dimendion的次序；  

**相同dimension的不同factor**分配到相同rank的不同slot时，会**合并**到相同的factor-dimendion；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20132.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20133.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20134.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20135.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20136.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20122.png)

用constant表示程序和Acc中的规律regularity；

张量I、W、A和**程序**dimension的关系A，张量I、W、A和**Acc** Buffer的关系B；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20137.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20138.png)

用variable、constant**表达Acc约束**，用于在约束下搜索设计空间

**Buffer Capacity约束**：register（level-**0**）、I/W/O-Buffer（level-**1**）、Global Buffer（level-**2**）、DRAM（level-**3**），确定level-I memoryt和确定张量v的存储占用**U（I，v）**；

空白slot默认分配**prime-factor=1**，便于用固定上下标累乘来收集factor，非线性的乘法约束**取对数**，转为线性约束求解；

下面公式的累乘i的**上标应是I？或者B（I-1，v）**

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20139.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20140.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20141.png)

X***A（j，v）**统计属于**张量v所定义dimension-j的factor**，X*A***B（I，v）**统计**存储在level-I memory里张量v的factor**，比如张量O不在global buffer（level-2）中，占用为0；

！！！：B（I，v）在累乘计算U（I，v）过程中是定值！

**（j，n）**累乘是**不同dimension的不同factor累乘**，dimension质因数分解的逆过程；

**k**累乘是**dimension时间tiling或空间映射的factor累乘**，dimension按时间tiling的factor表示**串行#factor次tile**（记为k=1），dimension映射到空间的factor表示**#factor个tile并行**（记为k=0）；

**i**累乘是level-I memory的**I/W/O tiles**存储需求需要将分配到level-**0~I memory的factor累乘**，高层tile按时间tiling或空间映射到若干低层的sub-tile，对应程序的嵌套loop；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20122.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20136.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20138.png)

Spatial Resource约束：估计schedule在**level-I** memory的**空间**资源占用（i=I，k=0），X（j，n，I，0）是factor分配标记；

每个factor分配到temporal或spatial，公式3中应该是 $\forall (j,n) \ \exist i$ ？

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20142.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20143.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20136.png)

目标函数——Utilization：提高Buffer使用率，达到更低的通信开销；

最大化**系统Util**，**Util**是每个存储层次**level-i**下**张量I、W、O**的**U（i，v）**求和；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20144.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20145.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20138.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20141.png)

目标函数——Compute Latency：用**迭代次数量化延迟**进行优化，而不是具体延迟数值；

最小化计算延迟，延迟是每个存储层次**level-i**下每个temporal **factor（j，n，k=1）**求和；

这个函数和schedule的k=1处的factor分配有关；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20146.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20136.png)

目标函数——Traffic：每次传输的**数据量**、#spatial factor数量的**广播和单播**、#temporal factor数量的**迭代**；

data size per transfer：类似张量v在level-l的占用U（I，v），但**不需要B（I，v）**判断level-I是否存储张量v，计算**张量v在全部level memory的占用**，即将分配后张量v的dimension-factor重新收集；

？？？可以直接用张量demension计算，不需要从factor构建，和schedule无关？

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20147.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20136.png)

#spatial factor数量的**广播和单播**

映射后的#spatial factor空间的GB（**level I**） traffic可能是multicast、unicast和reduction，spatial mapping（**k=0**）且dimension-j和tensor-v无关的#factor空间的traffic是multicast或reduction，统计traffic时需**多次传输张量v**；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20148.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20149.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20150.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20138.png)

#temporal factor数量的**迭代**

Y：是否外层NoC loop bound需要被不同变量X使用（计算traffic），即相同level下不同loop order中外层loop蕴含的迭代计算和传输；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20151.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20122.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20152.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20136.png)

Traffic=D*L*T：张量每个标量的traffic基本相同，用张量size乘次数；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20153.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20154.png)

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20155.png)

overall objective：最大化Util、最小化Comp、最小化Traffic设计综合的目标函数，或者平衡Comp和Traffic的目标函数；

![image.png](meeting-25%2010%2017%EF%BC%88%E5%A4%9A%E6%A0%B8%E4%BB%BF%E7%9C%9F%E3%80%813DGS%E3%80%81RL%20schedule%EF%BC%89/image%20156.png)

